    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a 'setback' though. three years is my entire life right now. i've missed weddings, i've missed everything because i was working on this. if the data is gone, the thesis is gone. and if the thesis is gone, my career is dead before it even started. i'm 29. i have nothing to show for it. i feel like i'm just a hollow shell of a person at this point. there's just nothing left to build on.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
